
commons-lang jar used during the release is not the one from Maven Central but a Release Manager's personal build
=> visible in the generated SBOM
but does not impact code aspects of the release = sources nor .jar binaries

not reproducible release from a reproducible project: it's just a build done in release manager specific environment that cannot be reconstructed by anybody (who would need the RM's commons-lang .jar)

